{
  "name": "STM Enhanced Monitoring — Kattegat/Skagerrak",
  "_comment": [
    "Demonstrates the three states Enhanced Monitoring must be able to tell apart.",
    "Load with vg1Scenario.load('./scenarios/stm-kattegat-demo.json'), then push the",
    "declared plans into the store with scenarioRoute.loadScenarioPlans().",
    "",
    "  NORDIC TRADER  — shares a plan and follows it.        ON_TRACK",
    "  BALTIC CARRIER — shares a plan and drifts off it.     DEVIATING",
    "  KATTEGAT STAR  — shares NO plan at all.               UNMONITORED",
    "",
    "That third vessel is the important one. It is not compliant and it is not",
    "deviating — it is unknown, which is the true state of essentially all live",
    "AIS traffic. A demo that shows only the first two teaches an operator to read",
    "'no route drawn' as 'fine'. See docs/STM_ROUTE_SPEC.md section 5.8.",
    "",
    "Geography is the Gothenburg approaches out through the Skagerrak, which is",
    "where the STM Validation project's own published test data lives."
  ],
